| 1970-01-01T00:00:30 | 1.0                                     | b    |
| 1970-01-01T00:01:00 | 0.1                                     | a    |
| 1970-01-01T00:01:00 | 1.0                                     | b    |
+---------------------+-----------------------------------------+------+

